:name: NUCLEO-H533RE SWP slave demo
:description: An STM32H533RE playing the UICC end of an SWP link. A host TCP
:description: client on port 3460 is the CLF: it activates the link and sends
:description: raw bytes; the firmware frames and answers them.

$bin ?= @firmware/build/swp-demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "nucleo_h533re"

include @peripherals/SWP.cs
include @peripherals/SWPController.cs
include @peripherals/SWPSlave.cs
include @peripherals/SWPRegisterInterface.cs
include @peripherals/ChipEventController.cs
include @peripherals/SWPChipEventController.cs

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/nucleo_h533re.repl

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart3

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

echo ""
echo "NUCLEO-H533RE ready. The board is the UICC; you are the CLF."
echo "  raw link data:  tcp://127.0.0.1:3460"
echo "  link events:    tcp://127.0.0.1:3456   (0x07 activate, 0x08 deactivate)"
echo "  console:        sysbus.usart3"
echo ""
echo "  sysbus.swp Activate        bring the link up"
echo "  sysbus.swp Status          link state, timings, byte counters"
echo ""
